<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="ff928aaf">&lt;p&gt;
    The risk description should read as if something went wrong and what the impact would be (e.g. Customer shipments are
    delayed, resulting in a loss of sales due to customer dissatisfaction).
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
