<attribute name="briefOutline" nodeId="c46a2ab4">&lt;p&gt;
    Each risk identified in the Risks List should have the following attributes:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Risk Unique ID
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Risk description
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Risk type (financial, operational, compliance…)
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Risk level (based on likelihood and impact)
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
